.TH sam-jail-doctor 1 2026-11-16 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-doctor \- Check the system (or one app) for problems
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail doctor\fR [\fB\-\-contracts\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIAPP\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check the system (or one app) for problems
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-contracts\fR
Check SAM\*(Aqs contracts with the outside world instead (docs/contracts.md): which hold on this computer, which are broken, with the versions of the components involved
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIAPP\fR]

